#namecost("INSTINCTIVE BEHAVIOUR", "")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Without the Hive Mind's grip, a Tyranid organism falls back on the appetites it was grown from. At the start of each friendly turn, each unit with this special rule that is not within 12\" of a friendly Synapse creature and not engaged in close combat must take a Leadership test on its own Leadership. If the test is failed, the unit is governed by its instinct, shown in brackets after the rule, until the start of its next friendly turn:"),))
