#namecost("SHADOW IN THE WARP", "")
#para(((emph: "", text: "The Hive Mind does not wield the Winds of Magic — it smothers them. A Tyranids army has no Wizards, never generates or receives power or dispel dice, and can never cast or dispel spells."),))
